<title>DENMARK: Danske Bank to open Helsinki branch in '97.</title>
<headline>Danske Bank to open Helsinki branch in '97.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's biggest bank Den Danske Bank A/S announced on Thursday plans to open a new branch office in the Finnish capital of Helsinki in February 1997.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the new Helsinki office would primarily service business customers.</p>
<p>Den Danske Bank set up a Swedish branch in Stockholm in 1995 and plans to open in Oslo, the Norwegian capital, next spring.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
